        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Crewe and Nantwich, Cheshire\n- People: Laura Smith, Edward Timpson\n- Organizations: UK Parliament, House of Commons, Labour Party, Conservative Party\n- Roles: Member of Parliament\n- Events: 2017 general election\n\nFacts:\n- In 2017, Laura Smith of the Labour Party was elected Member of Parliament for Crewe and Nantwich in the 2017 general election.\n- In 2017, Laura Smith defeated incumbent Conservative Edward Timpson in Crewe and Nantwich.\n- Since 2017, Crewe and Nantwich in Cheshire has been represented in the House of Commons of the UK Parliament by Laura Smith.\n- Laura Smith is a British politician.",
